{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17434","headline":"离合诗赠张监阁老 · 权德舆","name":"离合诗赠张监阁老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄叶从风散，暗嗟时节换。\n忽见鬓边霜，勿辞林下觞。\n躬行君子道，身负芳名早。\n帐殿汉官仪，巾车塞垣草。\n交情剧断金，文律每招寻。\n始知蓬山下，如见古人心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17434.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17434","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}